    {
      "id": "Q4",
      "themeId": "CW-011",
      "order": 4,
      "type": "self_analysis_kbat",
      "title": {
        "en": "Independent Scenario Analysis: candlestick anatomy",
        "zh": "独立情境分析：将K线结构解读为市场竞价行为记录"
      },
      "prompt": {
        "en": "Analyse both a valid and an invalid interpretation of reading candlestick anatomy as a record of auction behaviour using the assigned chart. Compare the evidence, explain the risk boundary, identify what would change your conclusion and state when no trade is preferable.",
        "zh": "使用指定图表分析将K线结构解读为市场竞价行为记录的有效与无效解读。比较证据，解释风险边界，说明哪些变化会改变结论，并指出何时不交易更合适。"
      },
      "instructions": {
        "en": "Write an original evidence-based analysis. Do not present the response as personal financial advice.",
        "zh": "撰写原创且以证据为基础的分析。不得将回答表述为个人财务建议。"
      },
